== gate analysis
# Gate G1: H2 HOLDS, H3 HOLDS

**Story:** Both hold: alignment concentrates first-token mass; truncation deletes the tail. P5 fix targets the first token.

RBU = robust RBU (docs/04 s.2), mean over templates, cluster-bootstrap 95% CI over categories. Recognition uses the a-priori probe (option B, notes/decisions.md).

