## Rules

- H2 per family (ratio at least 1.5, p < 0.01, base to final): {'qwen2.5': True, 'olmo2': True}; OLMo dips across stages: 1 (at most 1 allowed) -> **H2 holds**
- H3 per family (share failing at position 0 at least 60%, final model): {'qwen2.5': 0.841, 'olmo2': 0.738} -> **H3 holds**
- Mechanism (exploratory): Spearman correlation of first-token top-1 mass with RBU across (model, category) points: 0.817 (n = 66)

